{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01843",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.03,
      "end_seconds": 4.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.49,
      "end_seconds": 10.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.09,
      "end_seconds": 14.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "I've been dealing with an itchy scalp."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.19,
      "end_seconds": 19.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.6,
      "end_seconds": 24.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "I've had it since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.44,
      "end_seconds": 34.94,
      "duration_seconds": 9.5,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.87,
      "end_seconds": 44.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "Maybe a six out of ten on a bad day. It's every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.71,
      "end_seconds": 49.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "So, have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.28,
      "end_seconds": 67.96,
      "duration_seconds": 16.68,
      "text": "It usually comes with seeing tiny bugs in the hair. The seeing tiny bugs in the hair? That's been for about four days. There was scratch marks on the neck, yes, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.54,
      "end_seconds": 73.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "Have you had an itchy scalp before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.41,
      "end_seconds": 80.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "A bit, about six months ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.11,
      "end_seconds": 83.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.85,
      "end_seconds": 86.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.84,
      "end_seconds": 91.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.48,
      "end_seconds": 97.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "I mean, no, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.67,
      "end_seconds": 106.28,
      "duration_seconds": 7.61,
      "text": "Right, are there any allergies I should be aware of? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.04,
      "end_seconds": 109.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Yes, wheat. I get bloating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.79,
      "end_seconds": 118.24,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.34,
      "end_seconds": 122.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Not really, uh, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.44,
      "end_seconds": 132.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.28,
      "end_seconds": 136.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.73,
      "end_seconds": 139.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.1,
      "end_seconds": 145.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.14,
      "end_seconds": 150.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.93,
      "end_seconds": 155.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.16,
      "end_seconds": 159.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.08,
      "end_seconds": 163.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.24,
      "end_seconds": 171.24,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "Have you had any swollen glands, fever or rash on the body?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.56,
      "end_seconds": 177.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "No, no swollen glands, fever or rash on the body."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.82,
      "end_seconds": 184.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.45,
      "end_seconds": 188.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.26,
      "end_seconds": 193.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.69,
      "end_seconds": 209.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.33,
      "end_seconds": 238.94,
      "duration_seconds": 9.61,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 68, SpO2 98 percent on room air. And temp 36.7 degrees, BP is 128 over 69."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.02,
      "end_seconds": 244.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.96,
      "end_seconds": 260.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.4,
      "end_seconds": 264.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.16,
      "end_seconds": 289.09,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "I can see live lice and small eggs close to the roots behind the ears."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.29,
      "end_seconds": 299.64,
      "duration_seconds": 6.35,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit up now. Okay, thinking it through, it points towards head lice."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.03,
      "end_seconds": 304.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.92,
      "end_seconds": 314.34,
      "duration_seconds": 8.42,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's head lice, and we'll watch how it goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.84,
      "end_seconds": 338.53,
      "duration_seconds": 13.69,
      "text": "Comb the hair with a fine comb every few days and check the family. Come back if lice persist after two treatments. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.19,
      "end_seconds": 341.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    }
  ]
}